# /public/build is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# The production server (aaPanel) has no Node, so the compiled assets travel in
# the repository and a deploy is just `git pull`. The cost is real and has to be
# paid on purpose: after ANY change to a Blade view or to CSS, `npm run build`
# and commit the result, or the server will serve assets that look fine and are
# stale -- which is worse than missing ones, because a missing build is
# obviously broken and a stale one is quietly wrong. See DEPLOYMENT.md step 6.
/public/hot
/public/storage
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
/vendor
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
Thumbs.db
